# Intentionally empty. Its presence stops Grafana logging
# "can't read alerting provisioning files from directory" on startup - see
# grafana/provisioning/plugins/.gitkeep for why.
#
# This project deliberately alerts via Prometheus + Alertmanager (see
# prometheus/rules/*.yml and alertmanager/alertmanager.yml), not Grafana's
# own alerting engine, so this directory is expected to stay empty.
